NeDi bundles JavaScript and PHP libraries in html/inc (Chart.js, D3,
Leaflet, PHP QR Code and others), which are distributed under their own
licenses as stated in those files.

Changes made by this image (2026-11-05):

 - html/inc/header.php: PHP's E_DEPRECATED messages are hidden as well,
   because NeDi's PHP 7 era code floods the log with them on PHP 8.4.

 - /usr/share/perl5/Net/SNMP/Message.pm (Debian package libnet-snmp-perl,
   licensed under the same terms as Perl): records the send time of SNMP
   requests for NeDi's latency measurement, the same patch NeDi's
   installer nedian.sh applies.

Both files carry a notice of the change.

